WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.060
An SSH command names an image on leibo-asus.

2
00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:09.180
Connect to the paired machine with aih remote leibo-asus pane.

3
00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:13.240
Select the remote SSH shell and open its live output.

4
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:21.450
Press Ctrl-] then f to browse files on the remote machine.

5
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:28.560
The image is read from the remote machine and shown in the terminal.

6
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:31.665
Press any key to return to the same remote pane.
